            "pergunta": "What is she having for dinner?",
            "resposta": "«Spaghetti, gnocchi e gelato»: spaghetti, gnocchi and ice cream."
          },
          {
            "pergunta": "In which words do you hear the «ny» sound and the «ly» sound?",
            "resposta": "«Gnocchi» has the «ny» sound and «gli» (in «gli amici») has the «ly» sound."
          },
          {
            "pergunta": "How does Giulia say goodbye?",
            "resposta": "«Un abbraccio e a presto!»: a hug, and see you soon."
          }
        ]
